WEBVTT

01:36.370 --> 01:41.050
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.440 --> 01:43.950
[Episode 7]

01:45.270 --> 01:46.110
I knew it.

01:46.350 --> 01:47.000
Yes.

01:47.280 --> 01:48.340
Bad news! Bad news!

01:48.800 --> 01:50.130
The woodshed is on fire!

01:50.350 --> 01:51.680
The woodshed is on fire?

01:51.870 --> 01:53.350
Go, go, go!

01:53.350 --> 01:53.870
Hurry!

01:53.950 --> 01:54.479
Move!

01:54.840 --> 01:55.310
Hurry!

01:56.840 --> 01:57.400
Wait.

01:58.840 --> 01:59.840
It's a diversion.

02:00.950 --> 02:02.710
Let's go to Zhenmei Pavilion.

02:02.710 --> 02:03.240
Alright.

02:03.440 --> 02:09.070
[Zhenmei Pavilion]

02:04.040 --> 02:04.560
Come on.

02:06.400 --> 02:06.920
What...

02:08.360 --> 02:09.419
What's happening?

02:09.630 --> 02:10.430
I have no idea.

02:42.310 --> 02:43.079
Stop!

02:59.560 --> 03:01.420
Why did he suddenly kill himself?

03:09.200 --> 03:10.800
What are you guys doing here?

03:11.840 --> 03:14.280
I came to Miss Tang
to get my jade pendant back.

03:14.280 --> 03:16.070
I didn't expect to run into this.

03:16.070 --> 03:17.800
I saw him sneaking over here,

03:18.079 --> 03:19.079
so I followed him.

03:19.079 --> 03:21.010
Unexpectedly, as soon as he saw me,

03:21.280 --> 03:22.340
he tried to kill me.

03:25.240 --> 03:28.640
Xilou, they must have been knocked out
by some kind of powder.

03:29.900 --> 03:32.860
Mr. Qiu has served the Xiao family
for so many years.

03:33.560 --> 03:37.430
I never thought he'd be a spy
for the Power Gang.

03:42.079 --> 03:42.880
Let me ask you.

03:43.630 --> 03:45.290
What else did Mr. Qiu do today?

03:45.710 --> 03:47.710
He usually cleaned the Sword Manor.

03:47.840 --> 03:49.770
Today, he just went to the woodshed

03:49.800 --> 03:51.800
and helped Ms. Zhang water the flowers.

03:51.800 --> 03:55.190
The woodshed caught on fire just now.

03:56.190 --> 03:57.790
It was meant to lure us there.

04:18.870 --> 04:21.310
Father, Mother,
when he watered the flowers,

04:21.310 --> 04:23.270
he actually went to administer poison.

04:23.270 --> 04:24.330
Pass down my order:

04:24.630 --> 04:27.360
no one in the Xiao Residence
is to draw water from the well.

04:27.360 --> 04:28.240
Go check

04:28.800 --> 04:30.800
if the well has been poisoned.

04:31.310 --> 04:31.870
Yes.

04:35.040 --> 04:37.300
There's only one well in the Sword Manor.

04:38.120 --> 04:39.480
Now that it's poisoned,

04:39.920 --> 04:42.870
they mean to wipe us all out.

04:43.310 --> 04:45.390
Oh no! I just had the servants draw water

04:45.390 --> 04:46.190
to make soup

04:46.360 --> 04:48.310
and deliver it to Zhenmei Pavilion.

04:48.310 --> 04:48.800
You…

04:50.950 --> 04:51.480
Let's go.

05:00.070 --> 05:00.800
Mr. Zhang.

05:01.190 --> 05:01.830
Mr. Xiao.

05:02.830 --> 05:03.870
What has happened?

05:03.870 --> 05:05.360
Someone poisoned the well.

05:05.360 --> 05:07.310
The soup that was just
brought here is poisonous.

05:07.310 --> 05:08.240
Mr. Xiao.

05:20.560 --> 05:21.560
Don't worry.

05:22.510 --> 05:25.270
I haven't touched that soup yet.

05:25.750 --> 05:26.560
In this case,

05:26.720 --> 05:28.000
there's no need to keep it a secret.

05:28.000 --> 05:29.680
Go call everyone here.

05:32.860 --> 05:35.740
Everyone, this is Old Madam Wu.

05:38.360 --> 05:39.760
Greetings, Old Madam Wu.

05:41.480 --> 05:43.750
Greetings.

05:46.950 --> 05:49.310
Please be seated.

05:49.720 --> 05:51.050
Thank you, Old Madam Wu.

05:57.040 --> 05:57.870
Old Madam Wu,

05:58.600 --> 06:01.560
these are all heroes
who have stood with the Xiao family

06:01.560 --> 06:03.680
against the Power Gang.

06:05.830 --> 06:09.270
When I learned you were
all fighting the Power Gang out there,

06:09.720 --> 06:12.750
I couldn't eat or sleep in peace.

06:13.430 --> 06:16.360
I had no appetite for that soup,

06:16.720 --> 06:18.780
so I luckily escaped being poisoned.

06:20.950 --> 06:23.920
Old Madam Wu, why have you
come to the Sword Manor?

06:24.160 --> 06:26.890
I was going to the Immortal Pass
to look for my son,

06:26.950 --> 06:29.480
but while passing through Jinzhong,

06:29.870 --> 06:32.190
I was stopped by a group of people
from the martial world.

06:32.190 --> 06:35.190
They demanded that I hand over
the Hero Command Token.

06:35.480 --> 06:37.610
Thankfully, Mr. Xiao came to my rescue

06:38.180 --> 06:40.740
and let me hide here.

06:42.940 --> 06:43.740
Old Madam Wu,

06:44.110 --> 06:46.240
there's something I don't understand,

06:46.240 --> 06:48.440
and I'd like to ask you about it,
if I may.

06:48.760 --> 06:49.760
Please, go ahead.

06:49.950 --> 06:52.610
Old Madam Wu,
you're not from the martial world.

06:52.920 --> 06:55.720
Why do those people believe
the Hero Command Token

06:55.720 --> 06:56.680
is in your hands?

07:00.190 --> 07:02.600
Thirteen years ago,

07:03.040 --> 07:04.570
the Beihuang Army rampaged

07:04.920 --> 07:06.800
and seized our lands by force.

07:07.480 --> 07:09.120
They marched into Daxi

07:10.680 --> 07:13.390
and committed atrocities on our lands,

07:13.720 --> 07:15.380
doing whatever they pleased.

07:16.270 --> 07:18.190
People became homeless refugees.

07:18.190 --> 07:19.390
Protect His Majesty!

07:20.000 --> 07:22.270
The emperor was forced
to flee the capital.

07:22.270 --> 07:25.630
Daxi was on the brink of ruin.

07:32.310 --> 07:33.120
At that time,

07:33.430 --> 07:37.000
the leaders of Shaolin,
Wudang, and Emei Sects

07:37.190 --> 07:39.340
gathered heroes from across the country

07:39.340 --> 07:41.270
and forged the Hero Command Token

07:41.750 --> 07:44.630
with a crystal from the stars.

07:44.880 --> 07:46.480
They also swore a blood oath:

07:46.920 --> 07:49.270
whoever could save Daxi from destruction

07:49.750 --> 07:51.950
would be awarded that token.

07:53.240 --> 07:54.070
And in the end,

07:54.409 --> 07:56.650
someone truly did.

07:59.120 --> 07:59.920
Crazy Yan?

08:00.430 --> 08:01.230
That's right.

08:01.920 --> 08:04.560
Crazy Yan broke into
the Beihuang Army's camp,

08:04.830 --> 08:07.120
killed 37 elite guards,

08:07.830 --> 08:10.290
and nearly took
the enemy commander's life.

08:30.000 --> 08:33.320
So Crazy Yan got the Hero Command Token.

08:33.630 --> 08:35.909
But he was too arrogant,

08:36.150 --> 08:37.809
shunned by the martial world.

08:37.909 --> 08:40.960
After being besieged at Wuxing Mountain,

08:41.909 --> 08:43.510
he vanished without a trace—

08:45.320 --> 08:46.390
until recently,

08:46.910 --> 08:51.120
when he sent the token to me via a falcon.

08:54.510 --> 08:55.910
So the Hero Command Token

08:56.550 --> 08:57.840
was entrusted to you

08:58.670 --> 09:00.360
by Crazy Yan on purpose.

09:00.910 --> 09:01.630
Exactly.

09:04.550 --> 09:05.510
The Power Gang

09:05.790 --> 09:09.670
somehow learned that I had the token

09:10.630 --> 09:12.440
and began hunting me down,

09:12.960 --> 09:16.840
hurting innocents along the way
and causing needless bloodshed.

09:19.750 --> 09:20.600
Mr. Xiao.

09:21.240 --> 09:23.960
What's the situation outside now?

09:24.480 --> 09:28.670
The Power Gang has indeed
sent many men this time,

09:29.030 --> 09:31.960
but the Sword Manor is well defended.

09:32.390 --> 09:34.050
They won't be able to break in.

09:35.080 --> 09:36.000
However...

09:40.030 --> 09:41.290
Please, speak freely.

09:44.320 --> 09:47.000
They've poisoned the only well

09:47.480 --> 09:48.790
in the Sword Manor.

09:49.510 --> 09:53.720
We'll run out of the remaining water soon.

09:56.960 --> 10:00.000
Once again, I've put everyone in danger.

10:00.360 --> 10:01.670
I feel terrible about this.

10:01.670 --> 10:04.390
Old Madam Wu, you mustn't say that.

10:05.390 --> 10:07.600
General Wu has served the country
with absolute loyalty.

10:07.600 --> 10:10.440
He is a hero to us all.

10:11.030 --> 10:13.600
Throughout all of Daxi,

10:14.000 --> 10:17.630
only General Wu is
worthy of the Hero Command Token.

10:18.360 --> 10:19.000
This time,

10:19.960 --> 10:20.960
it's truly

10:21.480 --> 10:24.720
the Xiao family's honor

10:25.000 --> 10:26.530
to escort you, Old Madam Wu.

10:27.000 --> 10:30.270
If those villains were to kidnap you

10:30.750 --> 10:32.960
and distract General Wu,

10:33.270 --> 10:35.120
causing him to miss opportunities
on the front lines,

10:35.120 --> 10:36.150
the Northern Wastelanders

10:36.150 --> 10:38.480
would take advantage of it
and attack again.

10:38.480 --> 10:42.670
Then we'd become sinners of the country.

10:46.670 --> 10:47.550
Mr. Xiao,

10:48.080 --> 10:51.080
what's your plan now? Just tell me.

10:51.440 --> 10:53.480
I trust the Xiao family completely.

10:54.200 --> 10:56.360
The Power Gang poisoned the well.

10:56.750 --> 10:59.790
Their goal is to force us out.

11:00.510 --> 11:01.910
Outside the Sword Manor,

11:02.080 --> 11:05.750
there must be countless traps
waiting for us.

11:06.200 --> 11:07.320
But by agreement,

11:07.630 --> 11:08.480
in 2 days,

11:08.750 --> 11:10.790
we must escort Old Madam Wu

11:11.080 --> 11:12.840
to meet with General Wu.

11:13.840 --> 11:15.480
This cannot be delayed,

11:16.000 --> 11:18.870
nor can we sit here waiting for death.

11:34.550 --> 11:35.150
Father,

11:35.840 --> 11:38.100
if some of us leave the Sword Manor first,

11:38.510 --> 11:41.080
how long will the remaining water last?

11:41.720 --> 11:43.720
If some of us can get out,

11:44.150 --> 11:45.280
the remaining water

11:45.720 --> 11:48.480
is enough for 20 days.

11:52.960 --> 11:53.720
Twenty days…

11:55.480 --> 11:56.010
Alright,

11:57.120 --> 11:58.000
I understand.

11:58.550 --> 11:59.150
Everyone,

12:00.030 --> 12:01.510
we still need to escort Old Madam Wu

12:01.510 --> 12:03.480
to meet General Wu on time.

12:03.790 --> 12:04.790
Only by doing this

12:05.440 --> 12:07.390
can we break this deadlock

12:07.840 --> 12:09.080
and gain time

12:09.670 --> 12:11.480
for help from the other sects.

12:11.910 --> 12:13.150
Only by working together

12:13.150 --> 12:14.680
can we defeat the Power Gang

12:14.960 --> 12:17.030
and lift the siege on the Xiao family.

12:17.840 --> 12:19.300
But weapons show no mercy,

12:19.510 --> 12:21.240
and the Power Gang is ruthless.

12:21.630 --> 12:23.490
If we send Old Madam Wu out rashly,

12:24.030 --> 12:26.150
wouldn't that risk her life?

12:26.750 --> 12:28.810
Besides, in the martial world today,

12:28.960 --> 12:31.890
how many people dare
to stand against the Power Gang?

12:32.320 --> 12:33.450
Your plan is nothing

12:33.840 --> 12:35.240
but wishful thinking.

12:36.320 --> 12:38.720
We just fought
the Power Gang in the Sword Manor.

12:38.720 --> 12:40.240
Have you already forgotten?

12:40.240 --> 12:41.960
No matter how powerful the Power Gang is,

12:41.960 --> 12:44.080
can they overpower
the entire martial world?

12:44.080 --> 12:47.210
Moreover, everyone here
stands against the Power Gang.

12:48.390 --> 12:49.120
Old Madam Wu,

12:49.200 --> 12:51.400
please rest assured. I will do my utmost

12:52.150 --> 12:53.410
to ensure your safety.

12:55.440 --> 12:58.630
I've heard Huishan
speak of this boy before.

12:59.150 --> 13:01.750
He truly takes after
you and your wife the most.

13:03.510 --> 13:04.510
Qiushui is right.

13:04.910 --> 13:05.840
It's time for us

13:05.840 --> 13:07.370
to discuss how to break out.

13:08.360 --> 13:11.160
But the Power Gang
has surrounded the Sword Manor.

13:11.630 --> 13:13.550
They'll surely be watching closely.

13:13.550 --> 13:16.080
We cannot guarantee
everyone's safe escape.

13:17.000 --> 13:20.730
Indeed. Forcing our way out
would only result in heavy casualties.

13:20.750 --> 13:23.360
Besides, our only advantage now

13:23.790 --> 13:25.390
is knowing their target

13:25.390 --> 13:26.390
is Old Madam Wu.

13:27.720 --> 13:31.120
Why don't we come up with a clever plan

13:31.270 --> 13:32.200
to trick them?

13:35.840 --> 13:36.550
We can have someone

13:36.550 --> 13:37.950
impersonate Old Madam Wu

13:38.390 --> 13:39.030
as a decoy

13:40.030 --> 13:41.290
to distract the enemy.

13:44.080 --> 13:47.670
To ensure Old Madam Wu's safe escape,

13:48.120 --> 13:49.550
some of us must

13:49.870 --> 13:51.600
divert the enemy's attention.

13:52.550 --> 13:53.610
Then it's settled.

13:53.840 --> 13:55.960
The rest of us will do everything possible

13:55.960 --> 13:59.670
to ensure Old Madam Wu gets out safely.

14:00.670 --> 14:03.790
But if someone must serve as a decoy

14:04.390 --> 14:06.120
just so I can leave,

14:07.550 --> 14:09.150
I'd feel terrible about it.

14:09.870 --> 14:11.910
Old Madam Wu, don't worry.

14:12.180 --> 14:13.310
I'll draw them away.

14:14.960 --> 14:15.960
Qiushui.

14:16.960 --> 14:18.160
Mother, don't worry.

14:18.600 --> 14:20.440
Yiren and the others are not around,

14:20.440 --> 14:22.840
and I'm grown now.

14:23.200 --> 14:26.270
It's time I do my part
for the Huanhua Sect.

15:11.790 --> 15:15.600
Everyone, the Power Gang
has committed countless crimes.

15:16.440 --> 15:18.670
Rather than waiting for death,

15:18.960 --> 15:20.620
we might as well take the risk,

15:21.080 --> 15:22.080
fight our way out,

15:22.390 --> 15:24.190
get help from the martial world,

15:24.240 --> 15:25.840
and destroy the gang!

15:26.480 --> 15:27.120
Yes!

15:28.200 --> 15:30.240
Xilou, you're injured,

15:30.720 --> 15:33.250
so just stay here
in the Sword Manor this time.

15:33.360 --> 15:34.090
The rest of us

15:34.510 --> 15:35.790
will help Old Madam Wu,

15:35.960 --> 15:37.890
Qiushui, and the others break out.

15:41.790 --> 15:45.630
Everyone,
this journey is fraught with danger.

15:46.000 --> 15:48.150
Please take care of yourselves.

15:48.790 --> 15:50.520
I'll be waiting for your return

15:50.840 --> 15:52.790
to share wine and tea with you.

15:53.650 --> 15:56.310
-Rest assured, Xilou.
-Rest assured, Mr. Xiao.

16:11.080 --> 16:11.790
Qiushui.

16:14.600 --> 16:15.170
Mother.

16:17.030 --> 16:19.440
There are many skilled fighters
outside the Sword Manor.

16:19.440 --> 16:20.970
You must protect yourself.

16:22.440 --> 16:24.320
Shan, don't worry.

16:26.320 --> 16:27.600
Our son has grown up.

16:28.360 --> 16:30.870
Since he has chosen
to take on this responsibility,

16:30.870 --> 16:33.240
he must have thought it through.

16:34.000 --> 16:35.910
Trust his judgment.

16:36.510 --> 16:38.270
Children of the Xiao family

16:38.390 --> 16:41.870
don't make empty promises
without confidence.

16:43.960 --> 16:45.270
Father, Mother.

16:45.870 --> 16:48.550
I haven't spent much time with you
since I came back this time.

16:48.550 --> 16:49.280
Don't worry.

16:49.600 --> 16:51.260
I'll take good care of myself.

16:51.910 --> 16:52.910
Besides, Mother,

16:53.480 --> 16:56.080
I haven't had enough of your noodles yet.

17:02.630 --> 17:03.510
Take this.

17:05.310 --> 17:07.440
Besides the Three Styles of Boldness,

17:07.550 --> 17:09.200
I also have this treasure bag.

17:09.200 --> 17:10.859
It contains many mechanisms.

17:10.960 --> 17:12.960
You must keep in mind how to use them.

17:13.310 --> 17:15.640
Use them in the most devious way possible.

17:19.829 --> 17:22.030
Yes, your mother is right.

17:22.790 --> 17:25.310
Even I once…

17:25.440 --> 17:26.569
fell for her tricks.

17:30.590 --> 17:32.150
Neat trick. Neat trick.

17:34.070 --> 17:34.680
Qiushui.

17:35.720 --> 17:37.450
Earlier when we were drinking,

17:38.440 --> 17:42.070
you said you've always
admired those swordsmen

17:42.480 --> 17:45.480
who punish evil
and defend the weak with their swords.

17:46.160 --> 17:47.070
But, son,

17:48.000 --> 17:49.600
have you thought about this?

17:50.000 --> 17:53.240
Everyone is made of flesh and blood,

17:53.960 --> 17:55.490
naturally afraid of death.

17:56.070 --> 17:58.270
So why, when it's about justice,

17:58.920 --> 18:01.790
do those people no longer fear death?

18:05.790 --> 18:07.480
It's because in this world,

18:08.480 --> 18:11.830
there are things
more important than life itself.

18:13.590 --> 18:14.640
Today,

18:15.590 --> 18:18.920
so many friends are willing
to fight for our Xiao family,

18:19.400 --> 18:21.440
risking injury or death.

18:22.790 --> 18:24.480
Never forget their kindness.

18:26.200 --> 18:28.480
Father, Mother,

18:30.480 --> 18:31.610
I'll keep it in mind.

18:32.880 --> 18:34.550
Once Old Madam Wu is safe,

18:35.200 --> 18:37.310
I will seek help
from all sects in Jinzhong.

18:37.310 --> 18:40.030
Together we'll defeat the Power Gang.

18:46.110 --> 18:46.830
Go now.

18:53.110 --> 18:55.640
Take care. Take care of yourself.

19:02.960 --> 19:04.400
Father, Mother.

19:05.590 --> 19:06.510
Within 20 days,

19:07.830 --> 19:09.490
I will seek help from all sects

19:10.030 --> 19:11.960
and return to save the Sword Manor.

19:15.200 --> 19:16.600
Take care of yourselves.

19:22.590 --> 19:24.900
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

19:24.920 --> 19:29.630
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

19:29.890 --> 19:32.240
♪ The wind blows ♪

19:32.270 --> 19:36.710
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

19:37.310 --> 19:39.760
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

19:39.780 --> 19:42.250
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

19:42.270 --> 19:45.380
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

19:46.070 --> 19:53.440
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

19:56.650 --> 19:58.400
♪ The moon is reflected in the water ♪

19:58.450 --> 20:02.660
♪ Not even a ripple is left behind ♪

20:03.930 --> 20:06.790
♪ The broken sword can't be pulled out ♪

20:06.810 --> 20:10.930
♪ It's a heartbreaking punishment ♪

20:10.960 --> 20:13.380
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

20:13.400 --> 20:18.150
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

20:18.330 --> 20:20.540
♪ The wind blows ♪

20:20.560 --> 20:26.220
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

20:26.250 --> 20:28.080
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

20:28.110 --> 20:30.740
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

20:28.350 --> 20:30.920
Shan, it's alright.

20:30.770 --> 20:34.530
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

20:32.910 --> 20:35.870
Our son has grown up and become reliable.

20:34.550 --> 20:40.640
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

20:36.480 --> 20:37.200
Look,

20:38.160 --> 20:39.350
he has so many…

20:41.310 --> 20:45.790
brave and loyal friends.

20:44.560 --> 20:46.530
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

20:46.790 --> 20:49.270
We should feel at ease

20:46.940 --> 20:49.280
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

20:49.310 --> 20:52.340
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

20:50.310 --> 20:52.840
letting him make his way
in the martial world.

20:52.990 --> 20:59.280
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

20:53.790 --> 20:54.880
Alright.

20:58.750 --> 21:01.120
I want one more look at him.

21:00.470 --> 21:09.040
♪ As the flowers fall,
my heart falls with them ♪

21:21.310 --> 21:21.830
Kill.

21:32.240 --> 21:33.510
After breaking out of the Sword Manor,

21:33.510 --> 21:34.910
we'll split into 4 teams.

21:35.000 --> 21:36.900
Uncle Qu, Uncle Meng, and Uncle Tieyi

21:36.900 --> 21:38.640
will lead the Dragon Team
to draw their fire,

21:38.640 --> 21:41.040
giving the other 3 teams
a chance to escape.

21:42.000 --> 21:44.930
Old Madam Wu will hide her identity
with a black veil.

21:45.000 --> 21:46.790
Others will wear black robes

21:47.000 --> 21:48.750
and split into 3 groups to escort her,

21:48.750 --> 21:49.790
confusing the enemy

21:49.790 --> 21:51.320
and dividing their forces.

21:52.240 --> 21:52.790
Let's go!

22:10.310 --> 22:11.150
[Let them go.]

22:11.240 --> 22:12.770
[Take them down one by one.]

22:26.280 --> 22:27.840
Buy as much time as possible.

22:27.840 --> 22:28.900
Don't get exposed.

22:29.510 --> 22:32.200
Give Old Madam Wu's team more time.

22:40.420 --> 22:41.140
This way.

22:55.550 --> 22:56.680
Tang Fang, Feng Lang,

22:56.680 --> 22:58.830
you'll protect Old Madam Wu
with the Phoenix Team

22:58.830 --> 23:00.260
and break through from the eastern woods.

23:00.260 --> 23:00.910
Remember,

23:00.940 --> 23:02.380
keep your gas masks on.

23:02.470 --> 23:04.180
You'll pass through
a forest with toxic miasma,

23:04.180 --> 23:06.180
which will slow down the Power Gang.

23:06.270 --> 23:06.800
Besides,

23:06.970 --> 23:08.450
they're likely to believe Old Madam Wu

23:08.450 --> 23:09.930
would stay with Mr. Zhang.

23:10.200 --> 23:11.600
You'll be safer this way.

23:14.400 --> 23:15.370
The miasma forest is ahead.

23:15.370 --> 23:16.300
Put on the masks.

23:31.750 --> 23:32.280
Let's go.

23:42.370 --> 23:43.770
Uncle Kang and I will lure

23:43.800 --> 23:46.190
the Power Gang deeper into the forest.

23:46.550 --> 23:47.510
They're catching up!

23:47.510 --> 23:48.550
Go ahead with Old Madam Wu.

23:48.550 --> 23:49.240
-Yes.
-Yes.

24:25.030 --> 24:26.030
[In this case,]

24:26.400 --> 24:28.510
[I'll lure all of you here.]

24:39.420 --> 24:39.980
Go!

24:45.100 --> 24:46.210
Tang Rou, Yuhan, Zuoqiu,

24:46.210 --> 24:47.280
proceed with caution

24:47.280 --> 24:48.960
and find a chance to head up the mountain.

24:48.960 --> 24:50.510
The Power Gang won't expect anyone

24:50.510 --> 24:52.310
to go in the opposite direction.

24:58.030 --> 24:58.590
Go.

25:15.510 --> 25:16.970
Leave Old Madam Wu behind,

25:17.270 --> 25:18.730
and I'll spare your lives.

25:24.640 --> 25:25.440
It's you.

25:26.590 --> 25:27.520
One word for you:

25:28.160 --> 25:28.880
stupid.

25:29.790 --> 25:32.030
How dare you fool me? I'll kill you.

25:32.390 --> 25:33.510
I doubt it.

25:34.710 --> 25:35.320
Attack!

26:25.080 --> 26:25.750
No!

26:32.520 --> 26:34.220
G-Go.

26:35.720 --> 26:36.960
Go!

26:37.880 --> 26:38.640
Go.

26:39.400 --> 26:40.680
Go!

26:43.880 --> 26:45.030
Brothers,

26:46.000 --> 26:47.350
stop fighting!

26:50.510 --> 26:51.680
Let's go!

26:52.840 --> 26:53.510
Let's go.

26:54.160 --> 26:54.830
Let's go.

26:55.030 --> 26:56.480
Third Young Master, go!

26:56.880 --> 26:57.940
Let's go together!

27:00.680 --> 27:01.590
Come on, get up!

27:04.270 --> 27:06.640
The Xiao family once protected me.

27:07.000 --> 27:08.920
Today, I'm repaying that debt.

27:09.680 --> 27:11.310
Stop talking and go!

27:11.510 --> 27:12.960
Go!

27:17.240 --> 27:19.200
Third Young Master, go!

27:37.240 --> 27:38.200
Kong Yangqin!

27:40.470 --> 27:42.600
You're nothing compared to Fu Tianyi.

27:44.830 --> 27:46.030
You can't kill me.

27:47.400 --> 27:48.920
You can't kill me!

28:22.790 --> 28:25.320
This thing from Xiao Qiushui
is quite useful.

28:27.000 --> 28:27.860
What are these?

28:28.240 --> 28:30.690
They protect you from the miasma.
Take them.

28:30.690 --> 28:32.940
One each. Safety first. Put them on.

28:44.890 --> 28:45.790
Protect Old Madam Wu.

28:45.790 --> 28:46.450
-Yes!
-Yes!

29:38.700 --> 29:40.500
The target isn't here. Retreat.

29:50.960 --> 29:51.890
What's going on?

29:51.910 --> 29:52.790
Where is Old Madam Wu?

29:52.790 --> 29:53.790
I don't know either.

29:53.790 --> 29:56.390
Third Young Master asked me
to dress like this.

29:56.440 --> 29:57.370
Father, Mother,

29:57.830 --> 29:59.230
although Mr. Qiu is dead,

29:59.510 --> 30:01.440
the Power Gang has always been cunning,

30:01.440 --> 30:03.550
with spies everywhere
and endless schemes.

30:03.550 --> 30:05.210
To ensure nothing goes wrong,

30:05.830 --> 30:07.350
I have to change the plan
at the last minute

30:07.350 --> 30:08.350
to throw them off.

30:11.070 --> 30:13.830
You'll disguise yourself as Old Madam Wu
and leave with Feng Lang.

30:13.830 --> 30:15.230
Should I inform Mr. Feng?

30:15.510 --> 30:16.230
No need.

30:16.400 --> 30:17.130
Understood.

30:18.510 --> 30:20.570
Then what about the real Old Madam Wu?

30:21.850 --> 30:23.850
Mother, I have another plan for her.

30:25.110 --> 30:27.710
Why did Xiao Qiushui
suddenly change the plan?

30:28.240 --> 30:30.200
Where is Old Madam Wu?

30:31.850 --> 30:33.780
Find Xiao Qiushui, and we'll know.

30:40.480 --> 30:42.140
Hurry back to the Sword Manor.

30:49.210 --> 30:52.420
Why on earth did you come
to the Xiao Residence?

30:53.310 --> 30:54.910
Xiao Qiushui once helped me.

30:55.790 --> 30:57.030
It's only right that I help him

30:57.030 --> 30:58.090
fight his enemies.

30:59.240 --> 31:00.640
But since you came out,

31:00.920 --> 31:03.750
you don't seem
all that concerned about his safety.

31:03.750 --> 31:04.680
Compared to him,

31:05.260 --> 31:07.720
you care more
about Madam Wu's whereabouts.

31:08.400 --> 31:09.800
That doesn't seem right.

31:12.070 --> 31:12.750
Miss Tang,

31:13.720 --> 31:15.310
are you making such assumptions

31:15.310 --> 31:17.570
because you came with ulterior motives?

31:23.070 --> 31:25.070
Then why did you save me just now?

31:25.660 --> 31:28.050
It was nothing. No particular reason.

31:53.880 --> 31:54.680
Keep running.

31:55.550 --> 31:56.950
Why did you stop running?

31:59.940 --> 32:01.660
I'll break your bones

32:02.080 --> 32:05.280
and make them into plectrums for my qin.
What do you think?

32:05.920 --> 32:06.590
Fine.

32:08.310 --> 32:09.440
I won't run anymore.

32:11.350 --> 32:13.210
You're afraid to die, aren't you?

32:15.030 --> 32:15.880
Not really.

32:18.490 --> 32:20.020
I'll send you to your death.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.640
Kill him.

32:23.640 --> 32:24.720
-Yes!
-Yes!

33:19.440 --> 33:22.040
You slaughtered disciples
of the Xiao family.

33:23.470 --> 33:24.230
Take your qin

33:25.030 --> 33:26.710
and play it on your way to hell.

33:40.240 --> 33:41.350
This little trick of yours

33:41.350 --> 33:43.310
will only cost you your life.

33:44.920 --> 33:46.640
It's just the appetizer.

33:47.270 --> 33:48.870
Tell me where Old Madam Wu is.

33:49.240 --> 33:49.920
Or else

33:50.030 --> 33:52.400
I'll feed you to my venomous bugs.

33:54.530 --> 33:56.260
[Hua Gufen, the Poison Demon,]

33:56.260 --> 33:58.740
[this place will be where you die.]

34:37.110 --> 34:37.710
Tang Rou,

34:38.590 --> 34:41.520
you're skilled
with hidden weapons and mechanisms.

34:41.580 --> 34:43.909
This time, I need you to do me a favor.

34:45.540 --> 34:47.199
Fine. What do you want me to do?

34:49.630 --> 34:52.400
Big Brother, your recent actions

34:52.670 --> 34:54.730
have been rather hard to understand.

34:55.449 --> 34:56.090
Am I right?

34:58.260 --> 35:01.190
[Fu Tianyi is dead,
and the Xiao family is besieged.]

35:02.000 --> 35:04.260
[Who knows where the story will go next?]

35:05.230 --> 35:07.030
[I'd better take precautions.]

35:17.760 --> 35:18.690
Are you alright?

35:23.000 --> 35:23.630
I'm fine.

35:36.840 --> 35:38.440
What about the other guards?

36:00.000 --> 36:02.460
Y-You've been poisoned
by Hua Gufen's bugs.

36:02.720 --> 36:03.650
Let me treat you.

36:05.230 --> 36:05.880
No need.

36:07.920 --> 36:11.150
Xueyu gave me some detoxifying pills.

36:12.380 --> 36:14.490
I'll just take one later.

36:17.550 --> 36:19.550
What about Old Madam Wu and Tang Rou?

36:20.030 --> 36:21.490
Old Madam Wu and the others

36:22.480 --> 36:23.590
should be safe now.

36:24.030 --> 36:24.590
Tang Rou,

36:25.000 --> 36:26.590
take Old Madam Wu and Mr. Zhang

36:26.590 --> 36:27.960
to the cliff at the back of the mountain

36:27.960 --> 36:29.160
and leave from there.

36:30.190 --> 36:31.880
How are we supposed to cross that cliff?

36:31.880 --> 36:33.360
Don't worry. I have a way.

36:45.030 --> 36:46.340
This device from Qiushui is amazing.

36:46.340 --> 36:47.470
It can actually fly.

36:50.320 --> 36:51.050
Old Madam Wu.

36:52.840 --> 36:53.570
Old Madam Wu,

36:53.590 --> 36:54.520
are you alright?

36:55.320 --> 36:56.320
I am fine.

36:57.480 --> 36:58.900
Mr. Xiao's plan is brilliant.

36:58.900 --> 37:01.160
Let's take Old Madam Wu
to take a rest now.

37:02.480 --> 37:02.920
Okay.

37:06.430 --> 37:08.030
I'm glad Old Madam Wu is safe.

37:08.480 --> 37:09.210
But Mr. Xiao,

37:10.230 --> 37:12.760
why did you change the plan
at the last minute?

37:14.480 --> 37:15.680
In the martial world,

37:17.630 --> 37:19.830
the Power Gang's spies are everywhere.

37:20.360 --> 37:22.020
Their identities are hidden,

37:22.440 --> 37:24.770
and they're too cunning to guard against.

37:26.510 --> 37:28.590
I couldn't risk Old Madam Wu's life,

37:30.230 --> 37:32.430
so I changed the plan at the last moment.

37:43.320 --> 37:44.480
It seems my parents

37:46.090 --> 37:46.960
and uncles

37:46.960 --> 37:49.290
have safely retreated to the Sword Manor.

37:51.960 --> 37:53.020
It's getting late.

37:54.070 --> 37:56.000
We need to join General Wu's troops

37:56.510 --> 37:57.640
as soon as possible.

37:57.920 --> 37:58.450
Let's go.

38:15.030 --> 38:16.430
Greetings, Red Phoenix.

38:17.150 --> 38:18.510
You work for the Sword King?

38:18.510 --> 38:19.110
Yes.

38:20.070 --> 38:22.670
Who allowed you
to meddle in Master's affairs?

38:22.670 --> 38:24.630
Have you seen where Old Madam Wu went?

38:24.630 --> 38:26.760
My master only ordered us
to watch the Xiao family.

38:26.760 --> 38:27.880
We never went inside.

38:27.880 --> 38:30.140
How would we know
where Old Madam Wu went?

38:30.920 --> 38:32.280
I see.

38:51.530 --> 38:54.370
[The Sword King's men are
also looking for Old Madam Wu.]

38:54.370 --> 38:56.100
[I must report this to Master.]

39:29.070 --> 39:30.150
These places

39:30.660 --> 39:32.590
have all been infiltrated
by the Power Gang.

39:32.590 --> 39:33.940
After Old Madam Wu arrives,

39:33.940 --> 39:35.070
she'll need to rest.

39:38.280 --> 39:40.760
Tang Fang, go wait outside town.

39:41.280 --> 39:42.670
If you meet Old Madam Wu,

39:42.880 --> 39:44.340
give her a heads-up first.

39:45.270 --> 39:46.910
I'll go to Tongfu Inn

39:47.190 --> 39:48.940
to check out the situation there.

39:48.940 --> 39:50.900
Alright, be careful.

40:03.930 --> 40:05.230
[Tongfu Inn]

40:04.790 --> 40:06.790
Sirs, will you be dining or staying?

40:08.760 --> 40:10.700
Have the people from the west arrived?

40:10.700 --> 40:11.650
You are…

40:18.920 --> 40:19.760
No one has come,

40:19.760 --> 40:22.090
but there's a letter
I was told to deliver.

40:23.980 --> 40:24.870
[To Xiao Xilou]

40:34.660 --> 40:35.210
[Lingliang Town is
crawling with the Power Gang's men.]

40:35.210 --> 40:35.490
[Old Madam Wu is unsafe there.]

40:35.490 --> 40:35.770
[Wait for our smoke signal
in the Shili Forest in the southwest.]

40:35.800 --> 40:36.480
[We'll pick Old Madam Wu up.
—The Wu family's guards.]

40:45.190 --> 40:45.880
Thanks.

40:52.960 --> 40:54.160
Tomorrow afternoon,

40:54.280 --> 40:56.280
we'll meet at a different location.

40:57.280 --> 40:59.800
Do Old Madam Wu and the others
know the new place?

40:59.800 --> 41:00.730
They should have

41:01.460 --> 41:03.660
another way to pass the message along.

41:06.630 --> 41:07.560
No time to waste.

41:08.550 --> 41:09.080
Let's go.

41:09.280 --> 41:10.880
Make way! Make way! Make way!

41:15.110 --> 41:15.910
Any findings?

41:16.010 --> 41:16.670
No.

41:17.110 --> 41:18.320
Guard every exit of the town.

41:18.320 --> 41:19.780
No one is allowed to leave.

41:19.920 --> 41:20.470
Yes!

41:26.070 --> 41:28.280
What do you plan to do next?

41:30.710 --> 41:31.280
Let's go.
